.th AL I 8/12/77
.sh NAME
al - create empty files
.sh SYNOPSIS
al [-mode] file ... [-mode] file ...
.sh DESCRIPTION
Creates the specified files,
or truncates them to zero length
if they already exist.

.lp +8 8
mode	Octal value of access mode (as in chmod(I))
to be given to following files.
